        en: 'Without running: a tool scanned a module known from a hand audit to contain 20 real defects of the kind it targets. The tool raised 30 alarms, 12 of them matching real defects. Compute the tool\u2019s precision as a whole-number percentage — the fraction of its alarms that were real.',
